## Agent workflow

- Always create a plan before source edits.
- Parallelize independent analysis/verification; keep dependent work sequential.
- Use isolated worktrees for parallel writers and PR reviews.
- PR reviews must execute the full feasible unit and integration suites plus static checks.
- Do not claim completion without fresh executable evidence.

Version-controlled code, tests, schemas, rules, and ADRs are authoritative. Agent memory is a cache.
